  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaterStarters &#x2013; An initiative of MegaGroup &amp; Amref Ventures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovate - Drinking water</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MegaGroup and Amref have joined forces to create synergy in their two core competencies: water supply systems and community-led health promotion. This has led to the development of WaterStarters: a franchise that will rehabilitate and/or construct 600 boreholes, impacting the economic and health situation in rural and peri-urban Kenyan communities while offering impact financiers and donors an effective and sustainable program to finance. Aqua for All is supporting piloting the concept and aiming to prove that a blended finance model which includes commercial finance, is possible to create sustainable rural water supply systems while creating the necessary social and health impacts.</narrative>
  </description>
